   "card_vars": {
    "critic_list": "Priority order: none_v1_pooled (the blind prior every text critic sits on), depth_v1_pooled (told-depth diagnostic / p_mix), text_union_pooled_big (first natural-language sources over the content gate), enc_e2 (Qwen3-8B-L24 encoder adapter; the first critic to pass the RL acceptance on lens text), critic_para_p3 (paraphrase-augmented adapter; the first MEANING-reading critic: PMI(orig) +9..+12, paraphrase retention 0.74/0.84, twin_far 0.66), critic_v3b_fbp (v3 recipe, pooled, full pool), then none_v1_squash, text_union_pooled_n, critic_v3b_e2p / e2sentp, none_v2 (4.4B prior, stopped early), critic_v3a_nd (record). Steps are in each folder's best.json / eval_latest.json."
   },
   "builders": [
    {
     "kind": "strip_ckpt",
     "dst": "",
     "sidecars": [
      "best.json",
      "eval_latest.json"
     ],
     "src": [
      "/vol/critic/none_v1_pooled/ckpt_final.pt",
      "/vol/critic/depth_v1_pooled/ckpt_final.pt",
      "/vol/critic/text_union_pooled_big/ckpt_best.pt",
      "/vol/critic/enc_e2/ckpt_best.pt",
      "/vol/critic/critic_para_p3/ckpt_latest.pt",
      "/vol/critic/critic_v3b_fbp/ckpt_best.pt",
      "/vol/critic/none_v1_squash/ckpt_final.pt",
      "/vol/critic/text_union_pooled_n/ckpt_best.pt",
      "/vol/critic/critic_v3b_e2p/ckpt_best.pt",
